---
layout: base.njk
title: Apply for a Grant
permalink: /apply/
description: Begin with a short inquiry. Tell us about your organization and your project, and we will be in touch.
---
{#- Apply (client email, 2026-09-29, "Apply page - first-inquiry form fields"): a short
    first-inquiry form only, her seventeen fields in her order, no proposals or photographs on
    this page. Reached from the top navigation only (her rule, 2026-09-06 and 2026-09-29).
    Same shape as every page: a plain h1 and one paragraph, then the form on the page, no card.
    Round 7.5 (2026-10-29): the fields are gathered under five legends (Organization, Contact,
    Project, Budget and timing, Supporting documents) so the form reads as parts on a phone. Her
    order is unchanged; the groups follow it, which is why the dates sit with the amounts.
    Delivery is stubbed until a form service is chosen. #}
<section class="section section--hero">
  <div class="wrap stack">
    <h1 class="display">Apply for a Grant</h1>
    <p class="section-p">Begin with a short inquiry. Tell us about your organization and your project, and we will be in touch.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--page">
  <div class="wrap stack stack--lg">
    <div class="apply-form" data-apply-card>
      <form class="stack stack--lg" data-apply-form novalidate>
        {#- Date: auto-filled by the script, never typed by the applicant (her table, row 1). #}
        <input type="hidden" name="date" data-apply-date>

        <fieldset class="form-group">
          <legend class="form-group__legend">Organization</legend>

          <div class="field" data-required data-error="We need the legal name of the organization.">
            <label for="org">Legal name of organization<span class="field__req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <span class="field__hint" id="org-hint">As it appears on the IRS 501(c)(3) letter.</span>
            <div><input class="field__control" id="org" name="org" type="text" required aria-describedby="org-hint org-error"></div>
            <span class="field__error" id="org-error" data-org-error hidden></span>
          </div>

          <div class="field" data-required data-error="We need the EIN.">
            <label for="ein">EIN<span class="field__req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <span class="field__hint" id="ein-hint">Employer Identification Number.</span>
            <div><input class="field__control" id="ein" name="ein" type="text" inputmode="numeric" required aria-describedby="ein-hint ein-error"></div>
            <span class="field__error" id="ein-error" hidden></span>
          </div>

          <fieldset class="fieldset field" data-required data-error="Please choose yes or no.">
            <legend class="fieldset__legend">Is your organization a registered 501(c)(3)?<span class="field__req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></legend>
            <span class="field__hint" id="c3-hint">Grants go only to 501(c)(3) organizations.</span>
            <ul class="choices choices--row" aria-describedby="c3-hint c3-error">
              <li><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="c3" value="yes" required>Yes</label></li>
              <li><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="c3" value="no">No</label></li>
            </ul>
            <span class="field__error" id="c3-error" hidden></span>
          </fieldset>

          <div class="field" data-required data-error="We need the physical address.">
            <label for="address">Physical address<span class="field__req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <span class="field__hint" id="address-hint">Street, city, state, ZIP.</span>
            <div><input class="field__control" id="address" name="address" type="text" required aria-describedby="address-hint address-error"></div>
            <span class="field__error" id="address-error" hidden></span>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="mailing">Mailing address</label>
            <span class="field__hint" id="mailing-hint">If different from physical address.</span>
            <div><input class="field__control" id="mailing" name="mailing" type="text" aria-describedby="mailing-hint"></div>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="website">Website</label>
            <div><input class="field__control" id="website" name="website" type="url" inputmode="url"></div>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="form-group">
          <legend class="form-group__legend">Contact</legend>

          <div class="grid grid--form">
            <div class="field" data-required data-error="We need a contact person.">
              <label for="contact">Contact person<span class="field__req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
              <div><input class="field__control" id="contact" name="contact" type="text" required aria-describedby="contact-error"></div>
              <span class="field__error" id="contact-error" hidden></span>
            </div>
            <div class="field" data-required data-error="We need their title.">
              <label for="role">Title<span class="field__req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
              <span class="field__hint" id="role-hint">Pastor, administrator, board chair, etc.</span>
              <div><input class="field__control" id="role" name="role" type="text" required aria-describedby="role-hint role-error"></div>
              <span class="field__error" id="role-error" hidden></span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid--form">
            <div class="field" data-required data-error="We need an email address to reply to.">
              <label for="email">Email<span class="field__req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
              <div><input class="field__control" id="email" name="email" type="email" required aria-describedby="email-error"></div>
              <span class="field__error" id="email-error" data-email-error hidden></span>
            </div>
            <div class="field" data-required data-error="We need a phone number.">
              <label for="phone">Phone<span class="field__req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
              <div><input class="field__control" id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" inputmode="tel" required aria-describedby="phone-error"></div>
              <span class="field__error" id="phone-error" hidden></span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="form-group">
          <legend class="form-group__legend">Project</legend>

          <fieldset class="fieldset field" data-required data-error="Please tick at least one.">
            <legend class="fieldset__legend">Project type<span class="field__req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></legend>
            <ul class="choices" aria-describedby="ptype-error">
              <li><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="ptype" value="bells">Bells / tower</label></li>
              <li><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="ptype" value="organ">Pipe organ</label></li>
              <li><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="ptype" value="glass">Rose window or stained glass</label></li>
              <li><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="ptype" value="training">Artisan training</label></li>
              <li><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="ptype" value="other">Other</label></li>
            </ul>
            <span class="field__error" id="ptype-error" hidden></span>
          </fieldset>

          <div class="field" data-required data-error="Please tell us about the project.">
            <label for="description">Project description<span class="field__req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <span class="field__hint" id="description-hint">A few sentences is enough.</span>
            <div><textarea class="field__control" id="description" name="description" rows="6" required aria-describedby="description-hint description-error"></textarea></div>
            <span class="field__error" id="description-error" hidden></span>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="form-group">
          <legend class="form-group__legend">Budget and timing</legend>

          <div class="field" data-required data-error="We need the total project cost.">
            <label for="cost">Total project cost<span class="field__req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <span class="field__hint" id="cost-hint">In U.S. dollars.</span>
            <div><input class="field__control" id="cost" name="cost" type="text" inputmode="decimal" required aria-describedby="cost-hint cost-error"></div>
            <span class="field__error" id="cost-error" hidden></span>
          </div>

          <div class="field" data-required data-error="We need the funds already raised.">
            <label for="raised">Funds already raised<span class="field__req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <div><input class="field__control" id="raised" name="raised" type="text" inputmode="decimal" required aria-describedby="raised-error"></div>
            <span class="field__error" id="raised-error" hidden></span>
          </div>

          {#- Optional (client, 2026-10-16): grant amounts are discussed after the first review. #}
          <div class="field">
            <label for="requested">Grant amount requested</label>
            <div><input class="field__control" id="requested" name="requested" type="text" inputmode="decimal"></div>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="dates">Desired start / completion</label>
            <span class="field__hint" id="dates-hint">Approximate dates.</span>
            <div><input class="field__control" id="dates" name="dates" type="text" aria-describedby="dates-hint"></div>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="form-group">
          <legend class="form-group__legend">Supporting documents</legend>

          {#- Documents (Rogan, 2026-10-12): optional, up to ten files. Her "do not attach proposals
              or photographs yet" line under the form left with this, since it contradicted the
              upload. Upload delivery is stubbed with the rest. #}
          <div class="field" data-max-files="10" data-error="Please attach no more than 10 files.">
            <label for="files">Documents</label>
            <span class="field__hint" id="files-hint">Your proposal, photographs, or drawings, if you have them. Up to 10 files, PDF or images.</span>
            <div><input class="field__control field__file" id="files" name="files" type="file" multiple accept=".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.heic,.doc,.docx,application/pdf,image/*" aria-describedby="files-hint files-list files-error"></div>
            <span class="field__hint" id="files-list" data-file-list aria-live="polite"></span>
            <span class="field__error" id="files-error" hidden></span>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        {#- No opt-out (client, 2026-09-17): funded projects are shown on the site, stated once. #}
        <p class="apply__shared">Funded projects may be featured on this site, including the church, the work, and the artisans who carried it out.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <button class="btn btn--lg" type="submit">Send our inquiry</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>

    <div class="apply-form" data-apply-success hidden>
      <div class="stack stack--sm stack--start">
        <h2 class="apply__thanks">Thank you. We have your inquiry.</h2>
        <p class="section-p">We will read it and reply by email.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
